    {
      "id": "u_859ecfa4552e15dd2970f48f_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Google Keep has no native export process, but Google Takeout allows you to download a ZIP of all the notes.",
      "sourceHash": "859ecfa4552e15dd2970f48f9419c1a9c99322316dd3d4d390fed56b7805e4bd",
      "context": "Google Keep > Import process",
      "contextHash": "c8a5cd784e124aa38248b1bfc8d1d22360f6784760ec0bb37b8f8bb799fa5e3c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_0dcc3ae8f7473346334d6279_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The first step is to download your Google Keep information:",
      "sourceHash": "0dcc3ae8f7473346334d6279d43765bc9969ec606743cae3f7e07d249fdc355f",
      "context": "Google Keep > Import process",
      "contextHash": "c8a5cd784e124aa38248b1bfc8d1d22360f6784760ec0bb37b8f8bb799fa5e3c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a1fc5f274178a6feea125a05_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Navigate to __TRILIUM_PH_0__takeout.google.com__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "a1fc5f274178a6feea125a0568d8e15649ad6106e00148f6844a05659b68b5a0",
      "context": "Google Keep > Import process",
      "contextHash": "c8a5cd784e124aa38248b1bfc8d1d22360f6784760ec0bb37b8f8bb799fa5e3c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4c7fbd96db17246368b27564_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "In the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Create a new export__TRILIUM_PH_1__ section, press __TRILIUM_PH_2__Deselect all.__TRILIUM_PH_3__",
      "sourceHash": "4c7fbd96db17246368b27564462aeb727191369a7f093140b202a3587cbaecfd",
      "context": "Google Keep > Import process",
      "contextHash": "c8a5cd784e124aa38248b1bfc8d1d22360f6784760ec0bb37b8f8bb799fa5e3c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c4e7e627d3a7b74c152817c7_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "In the list of data to export, check __TRILIUM_PH_0__Keep__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "c4e7e627d3a7b74c152817c7fe1385af68fb759b6b8ff241a224ff27d0f5a902",
      "context": "Google Keep > Import process",
      "contextHash": "c8a5cd784e124aa38248b1bfc8d1d22360f6784760ec0bb37b8f8bb799fa5e3c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_e1957af457169463e6e8815b_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Scroll all the way down and choose __TRILIUM_PH_0__Next step__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "e1957af457169463e6e8815bdf957d987dc3bad2aadcded2d2ac50e59e27938f",
      "context": "Google Keep > Import process",
      "contextHash": "c8a5cd784e124aa38248b1bfc8d1d22360f6784760ec0bb37b8f8bb799fa5e3c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4a8e82ad3aa77ae412eda6c1_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "In __TRILIUM_PH_0__Choose file type, frequency & destination__TRILIUM_PH_1__ make sure the following options are set:",
      "sourceHash": "4a8e82ad3aa77ae412eda6c1002ad266e82c26adfe4a75a94134b6e1d290988c",
      "context": "Google Keep > Import process",
      "contextHash": "c8a5cd784e124aa38248b1bfc8d1d22360f6784760ec0bb37b8f8bb799fa5e3c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
