    {
      "id": "u_321753ea176383c625fbf8a2_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "When importing your notes from Google Keep, you might encounter some issues with how the notes are imported, or there might be some missing information. In this case, consider __TRILIUM_PH_0__reporting it__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "321753ea176383c625fbf8a273fe0ff0f09011c1344187745648337170355d42",
      "context": "Google Keep > Reporting issues",
      "contextHash": "7234a121f93fd08b195647b9559e5181cf282fa48f405f7af3d5d9c7a8ca25a9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_117f44a4dc4b8143dd5318c5_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "When reporting such an issue make sure to provide the following information:",
      "sourceHash": "117f44a4dc4b8143dd5318c5b597fa66186e508727e871e34df7eba85bf269c6",
      "context": "Google Keep > Reporting issues",
      "contextHash": "7234a121f93fd08b195647b9559e5181cf282fa48f405f7af3d5d9c7a8ca25a9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_8ada1ddf156f1368dae4af68_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "A sample of the note is required to better understand what happened.",
      "sourceHash": "8ada1ddf156f1368dae4af6892420414b881a7cc37f98facf7226abadc376dbe",
      "context": "Google Keep > Reporting issues",
      "contextHash": "7234a121f93fd08b195647b9559e5181cf282fa48f405f7af3d5d9c7a8ca25a9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_d1f89b8d77ceaaef984e00c4_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Because Google Keep has no per-note export, extract the Google Takeout ZIP and copy the files corresponding to the problematic note (__TRILIUM_PH_0__, __TRILIUM_PH_1__ and any attachments if you are able to identify them).",
      "sourceHash": "d1f89b8d77ceaaef984e00c4a56919c8124973de1ac6419ce3be9c707097a212",
      "context": "Google Keep > Reporting issues",
      "contextHash": "7234a121f93fd08b195647b9559e5181cf282fa48f405f7af3d5d9c7a8ca25a9",
